title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; week_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/kmtfund.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @reduce: Reduce fundraising efforts.
- @maintain: Maintain fundraising efforts.
- @increase: Increase fundraising efforts.

@maintain
subtitle: +0 funds per quarter.

We maintain our current income.

@reduce
subtitle: -1 funds per quarter.
on-arrival: income -= 1;

We decreased fundraising for our party within the province.

@increase
subtitle: +1 funds per quarter.
on-arrival: income += 1;

We increased fundraising for our party within the province.
